  identifier in real C source in one AND: crtl's names are short and a
  codebase's own are not (sqlite3VdbeMemGrow is 18 characters and no bucket
  has an 18). Without it the sweep cost +25% on sqlite's amalgamation, since
  it can no longer stop early the way five fixed headers allowed. }
